<title>USA: Watts sells Waterworks unit to Tyco.</title>
<headline>Watts sells Waterworks unit to Tyco.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH ANDOVER, Mass. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watts Industries Inc said it sold its Waterworks Valve Group to Tyco International Ltd for $90.6 million.</p>
<p>Waterworks Valve had sales of $85 million for the fiscal year ended June 30, 1996, Watts said.</p>
<p>Proceeds from this transaction will be used to fund the existing stock repurchase program and to support our continuing acquisition efforts in its core businesses, Watts said. Schroder Wertheim managed the divestiture process on behalf of Watts.</p>
</text>
